JOHN BROWN: Oh, thank you.

00:04:01.020 --> 00:04:01.690
MARK MANDEL: A little special.

00:04:01.690 --> 00:04:03.420
A gentleman by the
name of John Brown.

00:04:03.420 --> 00:04:05.300
