That would be awesome.

00:11:42.920 --> 00:11:44.211
FRANCESC CAMPOY: That is great.

00:11:44.211 --> 00:11:46.462
So tell us a little
bit about what you

00:11:46.462 --> 00:11:47.670
thought about the conference.

00:11:47.670 --> 00:11:49.947
I know you were really
busy building the demos,

00:11:49.947 --> 00:11:52.280
but were you able to follow
a little bit of the keynote?

00:11:52.280 --> 00:11:54.519
JOHN BROWN: So there
are so many people

00:11:54.519 --> 00:11:56.060
wanting to go through
the Emotobooth,

00:11:56.060 --> 00:11:57.990
that we didn't get to
